[en.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_FOR_WAR]
Armed to Teeth

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_FOR_WAR_desc]
Even the most peace-loving species must face a worrying fact: the world is becoming increasingly unstable, and the Kirin can no longer afford to remain aloof and enjoy peace alone.\nIn the face of external threats, we should not be angry at all times, but we must never forget our anger. At the beginning of the Kirin history, Nirikization was an instinctive behavior to protect the Kirins, the last line of defense. This line of defense needs to be practiced from time to time — perhaps this is the meaning of cycles after all.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_FOR_WAR]
擐甲执兵

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_FOR_WAR_desc]
即使是一个再热爱和平的种族也不得不面对一个值得担忧的事实：世界正在变得越来越不稳定，而如今的麒麟已经不像曾经那样可以置身事外独自享受和平了。\n面对外界的威胁，我们不应时刻愤怒，但也绝不可忘记愤怒。麒麟族诞生之初，逆麟就是保护麒麟的本能行为，最后一道防线。而这道防线，需要我们时不时的演练 —— 也许这本身就是轮回存在的意义吧。

